# Local `act` defaults (read automatically from the repo root).
# NOTE: act only reads lines starting with "-"; inline comments after a flag
# are parsed as arguments, so keep flags on their own bare lines.
--reuse
--pull=false
--action-offline-mode
# Medium image (~500MB). The global ~/Library/Application Support/act/actrc may
# pin a larger one; whichever is read last wins.
-P ubuntu-latest=catthehacker/ubuntu:act-latest
--env GIT_TERMINAL_PROMPT=0
# Add --container-architecture linux/amd64 if an action ships no arm64 build.
#
# On a colima host act needs a socket at the default path: it mounts whatever
# DOCKER_HOST points at into every job container, and a macOS unix socket
# cannot cross virtiofs. One-time, lost on reboot:
#   sudo ln -sf "$HOME/.colima/default/docker.sock" /var/run/docker.sock
